# Folds and turns the Duo with Tasks open, checking the toolbar keeps off the Tasks page each time it's
# back open upright: POSES=open-up scripts/duo tap <ref> scripts/duo-fold-taps
launch hexvoice:///?tasks
wait 3
shoot tasks
apart calls-button tasks-page
apart voice-settings-button tasks-page
pose cover-up
shoot cover-up
pose open-up
shoot open-up
apart calls-button tasks-page
apart voice-settings-button tasks-page
pose 150-up
shoot 150-up
pose open-side
shoot open-side
pose 120-side
shoot 120-side
pose open-up
shoot open-up-again
apart calls-button tasks-page
apart voice-settings-button tasks-page
